OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who groomed at least 70 girls and
OL,7,Fmanipulated them into sending sexually
OL,8,Fexplicit videos and images of
OL,9,Fthemselves has been sentenced to 30
OL,10,Fyears in prison.
OL,12,FBilal Kazi, 27, targeted his victims -
OL,13,Faged between 10 and 17 - using apps
OL,14,Fincluding Snapchat, Wink and Roblox
OL,15,Fbetween August 2021 and August 2025.
OL,17,FKazi, a student from India who was
OL,18,Fstudying at the University of Chester,
OL,19,Fposed as a 14-year-old white British
OL,20,Fteenage boy and made his victims
OL,21,Fbelieve they were in a relationship
OL,22,Fwith him.
